    "id": "9293421",
    "original": "「彼氏の友達と飲みに行ったら彼に激怒されちゃった」「その『友達』って、男？女？」「男に決まってるでしょ。どうして、彼氏の女友達と飲みに行かなきゃいけないの？」「そりゃそうだ」「彼ねトムって言うんだけど、めっちゃイケてるの。また行きたいな」",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "9821215",
        "text": "\"I went drinking with one of my boyfriend's friends, and now he's furious at me.\" \"Was this friend a guy or a girl?\" \"A guy, obviously. Why would I go drinking with his female friends?\" \"Yeah, you're right.\" \"His name is Tom. He's really hot, and I really want to go drinking with him again.\""
